        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-branching-random-walk-annihilation-measurement-mouse-branched-ductal-specimen-active-distal-tip-count-n-term>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-hannezo-branching-random-walk-annihilation-measurement-mouse-branched-ductal-specimen-peripheral-active-tip-radial-localization-r-r-max>,
